    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rock the Rim</i>, a cinematic visual novel that fuses the thrill of basketball and the passion of music with choice-driven storytelling. Step into Andr\u00e9\u2019s world: challenge rivals on the court, captivate hearts with your compositions, and unravel the mysteries of your past. Every decision shapes your narrative and destiny\u2014what path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/e89226e043006052725dced582118503.poster.avif?t=1751839378\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/e89226e043006052725dced582118503.webm?t=1751839378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/e89226e043006052725dced582118503.mp4?t=1751839378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1,400 cinematic static images and 46 cinematic animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 hours of immersive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 original songs composed exclusively for the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 atmospheric sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >54 ambient sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep choice system that shapes Andr\u00e9\u2019s journey</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story and Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Andr\u00e9, 18 years old, you're searching for your path in a world full of talent and pressure. Raised by Logan and Fiona, this house feels like anything but home. Blake\u2019s jealousy keeps pushing you away, while Kayla\u2019s quiet affection lingers in your thoughts. Faded memories\u2014unresolved secrets about your family\u2014follow your every step. Will you rise as a basketball superstar or light up the stage as a rock icon? Your choices will shape your relationships and determine how your story unfolds. Will you chase fame and leave the past behind, or be consumed by the weight of your memories?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/27d29ddf9a1ae0dec3001b81ebc8b1fe.avif?t=1751839378\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rock the Rim</i> blends the energy of basketball with the passion of music, wrapped in a cinematic mystery. Feel the thrill of Andr\u00e9\u2019s slam dunks, stage performances, and a dynamic world full of meaningful connections. With original music and cinematic animations, every moment hits hard. Replay again and again to explore different choices, paths, and relationships \u2014 write your story your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/aee603ed83e4ca3e74d1b361734b069e.avif?t=1751839378\" width=600 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/97c1243dd0adb90dd78a2931071f4bc7.avif?t=1751839378\" width=600 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episodes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rock the Rim: Season 1 - Episode 1</i> launches Andr\u00e9\u2019s adventure! This episode delivers a striking beginning. Continue with <i>Episode 2</i>, <i>Episode 3</i>, and beyond\u2014each available as separate DLCs. Andr\u00e9\u2019s past and future unfold step by step through these additional stories.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rock the Rim</i>, a cinematic visual novel that fuses the thrill of basketball and the passion of music with choice-driven storytelling. Step into Andr\u00e9\u2019s world: challenge rivals on the court, captivate hearts with your compositions, and unravel the mysteries of your past. Every decision shapes your narrative and destiny\u2014what path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/e89226e043006052725dced582118503.poster.avif?t=1751839378\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/e89226e043006052725dced582118503.webm?t=1751839378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/e89226e043006052725dced582118503.mp4?t=1751839378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1,400 cinematic static images and 46 cinematic animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 hours of immersive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 original songs composed exclusively for the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 atmospheric sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >54 ambient sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep choice system that shapes Andr\u00e9\u2019s journey</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story and Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Andr\u00e9, 18 years old, you're searching for your path in a world full of talent and pressure. Raised by Logan and Fiona, this house feels like anything but home. Blake\u2019s jealousy keeps pushing you away, while Kayla\u2019s quiet affection lingers in your thoughts. Faded memories\u2014unresolved secrets about your family\u2014follow your every step. Will you rise as a basketball superstar or light up the stage as a rock icon? Your choices will shape your relationships and determine how your story unfolds. Will you chase fame and leave the past behind, or be consumed by the weight of your memories?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/27d29ddf9a1ae0dec3001b81ebc8b1fe.avif?t=1751839378\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rock the Rim</i> blends the energy of basketball with the passion of music, wrapped in a cinematic mystery. Feel the thrill of Andr\u00e9\u2019s slam dunks, stage performances, and a dynamic world full of meaningful connections. With original music and cinematic animations, every moment hits hard. Replay again and again to explore different choices, paths, and relationships \u2014 write your story your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/aee603ed83e4ca3e74d1b361734b069e.avif?t=1751839378\" width=600 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/97c1243dd0adb90dd78a2931071f4bc7.avif?t=1751839378\" width=600 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episodes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rock the Rim: Season 1 - Episode 1</i> launches Andr\u00e9\u2019s adventure! This episode delivers a striking beginning. Continue with <i>Episode 2</i>, <i>Episode 3</i>, and beyond\u2014each available as separate DLCs. Andr\u00e9\u2019s past and future unfold step by step through these additional stories.</p>",
